{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55436","headline":"句 二 · 潘佑","name":"句 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荆溪百里水涵空。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷七《镇江府》。\n）（按：《纪胜》录此句，作者爲「潘佐」，「佐」爲「佑」之误。\n潘佑《送人往宣城》，《万首唐人绝句》卷九九、《全唐诗》卷七七○又收潘佐名下，可证。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"潘佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}